  m_text: 'Once everything is set up and that you are in the main menu, you should
    see a button called "NEW RANDOM EXPEDITION" instead of the original New Expedition
    button. Click it.


    In the first windowenter archipelago.gg: followed by
    the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating
    a new room.


    In the second window, enter the name assigned to your YAML
    file.


    The Password window''s field is optional. If the host did not set
    one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click "Confirm" and then, you can start a
    new run!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
