  m_text: "Once everything is set up, a new \"Archipelago\" button should appear
    in the main menu of Subnautica.\n\nIn \"Slot Name\", enter the name assigned
    to your YAML file.\n\nEnter archipelago.gg:XXXXX in the \"Server URL\" field,
    where XXXXX is the room\u2019s port. You can find this number on the website
    after creating a new room.\n\nThe \"Password\" field is optional. If the host
    did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, click \"Connect\" and start a new
    run!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
